# recursive interpolation not allowed

Tuuina-atu tusi: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Polokalama vaega: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), laina-fou.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Tuuina-atu tusi: a, laina-fou.


